msgid "Mamba F405 MK2 Flight Controller"
msgstr "Mamba F405 MK2 飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba405-mk2.rst:10
#: 793bcbec51264c73b92a21c95220210c
msgid ""
"The Mamba F405 MK2 is an autopilot produced by `Diatone "
"<https://www.diatone.us>`__."
msgstr "Mamba F405 MK2 是由 `Diatone <https://www.diatone.us>`__ 生产的飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba405-mk2.rst:13
#: e4a88080977d416faf1b520fb1bc1dcd
msgid ""
"This autopilot does not have a barometer. An external barometer can be "
"added, or operation with an alternate altitude sensor, such as GPS for "
"outdoor use or rangefinder for indoor applications is supported, with "
"caveats. In Plane, if GPS is lost, then the user should switch to a non-"
"navigation, non-altitude holding mode immediately. In Copter, operation is "
"allowed using GPS, but not recommended, due to the imprecision in altitude "
"hold modes. Bear in mind if GPS fails and the vehicle is using it for "
"altitude information, a crash can eventually result due to lack of accurate "
"altitude information.See :ref:`common-gps-for-alt` for more information."
msgstr ""
"此飞控没有气压计。可添加外部气压计，或使用替代高度传感器（如室外用 GPS 或室内用测距仪），但有注意事项。在 Plane 模式下，若 GPS "
"丢失，用户应立即切换到不需要导航或保持高度的模式。在 Copter 模式下，允许使用 GPS 运行，但不推荐，因为高度保持模式精度较差。请注意，若 "
"GPS 失效且飞行器正依靠它获取高度信息，最终可能因高度信息不准确而坠机。详情参见 :ref:`common-gps-for-alt`。"

