#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba405-mk2.rst:78
#: 28dd56caacd843a2b8afd03e93e2dd58
msgid ""
"RC input is configured on the SBUS pin which drives the UART1 RX pin via an "
"inverter. It supports all RC unidirectional protocols (ie Not PPM, FPORT or "
"other bidirectional protocols with telemetry). "
":ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` = 1 enables the RX1 pin for use with "
"bidrectional RX like CRSF."
msgstr ""
"RC 输入配置在 SBUS 引脚上，该引脚通过反相器驱动 UART1 RX 引脚。支持所有 RC 单向协议（即不支持 PPM、FPORT "
"或其他带数传的双向协议）。:ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` = 1 启用 RX1 引脚，可用于 CRSF "
"等双向 RX。"

