#: 02f9e58352af42669c3617b5a7b30c49
msgid ""
"The Mamba F405 MK2 supports up to 5 PWM outputs. The pads for motor output "
"ESC1 to ESC4 on the above diagram are for the 4 outputs. The first 4 outputs"
" support Bi-Directional DShot as well as all PWM types."
msgstr ""
"Mamba F405 MK2 最多支持 5 路 PWM 输出。上图中 ESC1~ESC4 电机输出焊盘对应 4 路输出，前 4 路支持双向 DShot "
"及所有 PWM 类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-mamba405-mk2.rst:92
#: 2560ddf5f34540459386d7dfe3d35814
