"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate and "
"protocol. If any channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the "
"group need to use DShot."
msgstr "同一组内的通道需使用相同的输出频率和协议。若某通道使用 DShot，则该组所有通道均需使用 DShot。"

